#
# ADORE secrets template. Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in.
# Non-secret settings belong in config.toml, never here.

# --- Host forge authentication ------------------------------------------------
# Authenticate `glab` or `gh` on the host that runs ADORE. Do not place forge
# credentials here: ADORE invokes the authenticated host CLI for forge access.

# --- Executor model provider ---------------------------------------------------
# The key(s) for the executor's configured provider. Add a key here only when
# its name is listed in [executor].env_keys; ADORE injects that limited subset
# into the executor container. Never bake keys into an image.
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#OPENAI_API_KEY=
